# Placeholder so git tracks this directory even when empty.
#
# Drop actual showcase screenshots here as PNG / JPEG / WebP files; the
# mirror-public.yml workflow copies the whole directory verbatim into
# the public showcase repo and the README.public.md references them
# for the marketing surface.
#
# Recommended captures (all from the V2-redesigned desktop CP + mobile):
#   - desktop-dashboard.png        (Hero already references this on the landing site)
#   - desktop-library.png
#   - desktop-clients.png
#   - desktop-transcoding.png
#   - mobile-home.png
#   - mobile-player.png
#   - mobile-library.png
#
# Naming convention: kebab-case, surface-screen pattern. Keep file sizes
# under ~500 KB each (use TinyPNG or similar) since they ship in the
# public repo and visitors load them on the showcase README.
